## Chat with any pdf you want

### Setup Steps:

#### Step 1 :&#x20;

For Windows

```python
pip install requirement.txt
```

For Mac

```python
pip3 install requirement.txt
```

#### Step 2:

Install [Ollama](https://ollama.com/) in device

#### Step 3 :&#x20;

Get [Llama2](https://ollama.com/library/llama2)

Or

```bsl
ollama pull llama2
```

## Done
