## 🏗️ System Architecture

<div align=""center"">
  <img src=""assets/dia2.jpeg"" alt=""EduGen System Design Diagram 1"" width=""400""/>
  <img src=""assets/dia1.jpeg"" alt=""EduGen System Design Diagram 2"" width=""400""/>
 
