agent.py,Recipes chatbot/venv/Lib/site-packages/langchain/agents/agent.py,e6f9df4939853790f7fcbf7b86547fe231364857,Apiljungthapa/NLP_GENAI,https://api.github.com/repositories/768627981/contents/Recipes%20chatbot/venv/Lib/site-packages/langchain/agents/agent.py?ref=11a77bc0946c4cd4c336c991be389187ea64e18f,https://api.github.com/repositories/768627981/git/blobs/e6f9df4939853790f7fcbf7b86547fe231364857,https://github.com/Apiljungthapa/NLP_GENAI/blob/11a77bc0946c4cd4c336c991be389187ea64e18f/Recipes%20chatbot/venv/Lib/site-packages/langchain/agents/agent.py,,,1,0,0,51,2025-02-21T08:35:02Z,2,0,"# Fine-Tuning Large Language Model (LLMs) on Colab's Free GPU's (Including 7B Parameter with Inference's)

Welcome! Here, you'll learn how to fine-tune any large language model (LLM) for your specific needs using your own dataset. Whether it's for your business, school, or any other endeavor, you can create a customized Q&A chatbot tailored to your requirements. Let's explore how you can structure a chat template and fine-tune an LLM model using Hugging Face Transformers.


## 1.1 Access Chat Template for Fine-Tuning Various Models

