The following dependencies are required:

```
langchain-core>=0.1.0
httpx>=0.24.1
typing-extensions>=4.7.0
pydantic>=2.0.0
langchain>=0.3.0
```

For LangGraph integration, you'll also need:

```
langgraph>=0.0.26
```

