| Engine   | Status                   | Notes                              |
|----------|--------------------------|------------------------------------|
| Ollama   | ✅ Required if selected   | llama3, mistral, gemma, phi, etc.  |
| OpenAI   | ✅ Optional               | Requires API key                   |
