## 📡 API Reference

### 🏥 Core System Endpoints

| Endpoint  | Method | Purpose        | Example                             |
| --------- | ------ | -------------- | ----------------------------------- |
| `/`       | GET    | API overview   | `curl http://localhost:8000/`       |
