This project is a Streamlit-powered web application for conversational question-answering over your own PDF documents, using Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) and Large Language Models (LLMs).

## Functionality
### Document Upload & Ingestion:
 Upload PDF files, which are automatically chunked, embedded, and stored in a Qdrant vector database.
### Conversational QA: 
Ask questions in natural language; the app retrieves relevant document chunks and uses an LLM (via Ollama) to generate concise, context-aware answers.
