<div align=""center"">

[![Python](https://img.shields.io/badge/Python-3.8+-blue.svg)](https://python.org)
[![FastAPI](https://img.shields.io/badge/FastAPI-0.100+-green.svg)](https://fastapi.tiangolo.com)
