```shell
python neuma.py -m term -i ""join all PDFs in this directory ordered by name into presentation.pdf""
pdfunite $(ls -1v *.pdf) presentation.pdf
```

## Color theme

The colors of each type of text (prompt, answer, info msg, etc.) are defined in the `config.toml` file (default is [gruvbox](https://github.com/morhetz/gruvbox) dark).

```toml
[theme]
section = ""#d3869b"" # pink
info = ""#8ec07c""    # aqua
success = ""#b8bb26"" # green
warning = ""#fabd2f"" # yellow
error = ""#fb4934""   # red
prompt = ""#928374""  # grey
answer = ""#83a598""  # blue
```

## Troubleshooting

If you get a `ImportError: GLIBCXX_3.4.30 not found` error during install, run the following command:

```shell
conda install -c conda-forge gcc=12.1.0
``` 


## What's in a name?

`neuma` is derived from the greek `πνεῦμα` meaning _breath_ or _spirit_."
