|----------------|-----------------------------|
| id             | integer                     |
| product_id     | integer                     |
| role_id        | integer                     |
| teammember_id  | integer                     |
| allocation     | numeric                     |
| is_active      | boolean                     |
| created_at     | timestamp without time zone |

### `skills_matrix`
| column_name     | data_type                   |
|-----------------|-----------------------------|
| id              | integer                     |
| teammembers_id  | integer                     |
