tools.py,venv/Lib/site-packages/langchain_core/tools.py,85db1d3b92eb4393bb7e399dac52e6dbabc382fc,pawan-kumar-108/Personal-AI-Asssistant,https://api.github.com/repositories/833240751/contents/venv/Lib/site-packages/langchain_core/tools.py?ref=19bc84d3b02e011a6e04fb73daf0abfee6af376c,https://api.github.com/repositories/833240751/git/blobs/85db1d3b92eb4393bb7e399dac52e6dbabc382fc,https://github.com/pawan-kumar-108/Personal-AI-Asssistant/blob/19bc84d3b02e011a6e04fb73daf0abfee6af376c/venv/Lib/site-packages/langchain_core/tools.py,Your personal AI assistant powered by OpenAI API that help you in solving your problems by remembering the conversation. It can anwer the question by analyzing the previous messages as well.,,0,0,0,3,2024-07-24T18:30:56Z,0,0,"# Personal AI Assisztant

This AI Assistant is made using:

 Tech Stack:
 1. OpenAI API
 2. Langchain
 3. Flask
 4. HTML/CSS

Special feature of this chatbot is that it can answer your queries instantly and suggest you information based on the question you will ask.

It has In Memory Buffer which gives a special edge over traditional chatbots.

It can remember all the conversation until you close the window. 

## Installation

1. Clone this repo:
```
https://github.com/pawan-kumar-108/Personal-AI-Asssistant.git
cd Personal-AI-Asssistant
```

2. Create and activate a virtual environment:
```
python -m venv venv
source venv\Scripts\activate

```

3. Install the required libraries:
 ```
    pip install requirements.txt
 ```

4. Set up your API key for OpenAI:
- Create a file named api_key.py in the project directory.
- Add your API key in the file:

  ```
  API_KEY = 'your_api_key'
  ```
5. Run the below line on terminal
   ```
   python app.py
   ```




